  "details": "Description of the bug:\n\nTrying to adjust the HUD Position on an On Hud radial menu will result in the HUD Position wheel to get stuck. Causing the Radial Menu to get stuck in a position, this position can be offscreen on the HUD.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\n1) Open up your radial menu.\n\n2) Turn the On Hud option \"On\"\n\n3) Click on HUD Position.\n\n4) Radial Menu should now be stuck in a position and cannot be moved around.\n\nBehavior is slightly different in the Left hand Radial Menu.",
